# Instance CSV Import / Export

Bulk **Admin/DB** workflow for `v2_instance` (Web **Session** — bookable offering). See `product-hierarchy.mdc`.

**Full operator spec:** [`scripts/design/instance-csv-import.md`](scripts/design/instance-csv-import.md)

## Scope

- **CLI only** — no Admin UI upload for instance CSV.
- **Schema mode only:** one CSV per `v2_offering_type.code` + `{basename}-schema.json` manifest.
- **Runs locally** via `.env.local` (`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`).

Legacy unified wide-table scripts archived under `_archive/scripts/` (2026-06).

## Pipeline

```text
Import offerings first (Session Title = v2_offering.name)
  → Export instances per type (DB → CSV + manifest)
  → Edit CSV (id empty for INSERT; keep id for UPDATE)
  → Import dry-run → Import --execute
```

Bootstrap: `node scripts/bootstrap-instance-csv.js`

